                    <span class="service-number">03</span><div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 15px;" aria-hidden="true">⚡</div>
                    <h3 style="color: #ff5500; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.2rem;">Spark Plug Replacement</h3>
