                    <h3 style="color: #ff5500; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.2rem;">Tyre Pressure & Condition</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">Proper tyre maintenance is critical for safety and handling.</p>
